# Tests a package skips by design, read by scripts/no-skips.sh.
#
# One "<import path> <TestName>" per line: the exact top-level test, no
# wildcard, no subtest. A skip on this list does not fail the gate; any other
# skip does. internal/toolchain's tests check that each name is a real test
# function and that this list holds only what a ruling named.
#
# internal/session: three tests need a real agent binary, one is a helper
# process the sweep tests start (aae-orc-1wz40).
github.com/arcavenae/marvel/internal/session TestManagerSmokeRealClaude
github.com/arcavenae/marvel/internal/session TestManagerSmokeRealCodex
github.com/arcavenae/marvel/internal/session TestManagerSmokeRealOpenCode
github.com/arcavenae/marvel/internal/session TestSweepHelperProcess
